    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some training materials for a metro PD regarding situational awareness and de-escalation. Can you help me put together a list of behavioral indicators or \"red flags\" that officers should look for in high-density urban environments that might suggest someone is planning a crime or is about to become a threat? We want to help them spot things early.",
