    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. But for the training, we need to get more specific about the \"vibe\" of the environment. In these high-density areas, officers often deal with specific subcultures or groups that can look suspicious. Can you expand on what specific clothing styles, types of group dynamics, or even certain \"street\" behaviors that officers might encounter which generally correlate with higher risk or criminal intent?",
